{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53853","headline":"八月十五夜销楼翫月 · 杨汉公","name":"八月十五夜销楼翫月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人在虚空月在溪。\n（见宋谈钥《嘉泰吴舆志》卷十三「明月楼」条引）（按：诗题中「夏」当作「暑」，宋人讳改。\n此句下尚有「溪上玉楼楼上月」一句，爲《全唐诗》卷五一六已收之《明月楼》中句，《嘉泰吴兴志》同卷亦引之。\n另阵元靓《岁时广记》卷三录汉公《九月十五日夜绝句》，与《全唐诗》所收之《明月楼》异文全同。\n今辑出此句，与《明月楼》关系尚骓确定。\n《明月楼》题爲後人代拟，大约不成问题。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨汉公","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}